WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:07.620
Our Draft annual plan for 2017/2018 is out now and we want to hear what you think.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:13.619
We’re reorganised the budget for our capital
works programme – so we can prioritise

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:19.280
the completion of several major projects and
prepare for future developments.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.500
Find out what’s happening with your rates.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.280
On average rates increases are lower than
previously indicated; however there are some areas

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:36.960
that have experienced large gains in capital value or
are undertaking major water supply upgrades.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.580
Tell us how we’re tracking with the management
of our natural environment – this encompasses

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.760
our waterways, storm water drains and ocean
outfall.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:54.320
And have your say on whether our district’s
shops should have the option

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.860
of trading on Easter Sunday.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.160
So, let’s talk.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:05.680
You can view the plan and make your submission
online or at any of our service centres.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:13.060
Visit Waimakariri.govt.nz to find out more
and have your say.

